# The image only copies the published package, so everything else is context the daemon does not
# need to receive. Without this the build ships .git, node_modules and every build output.
*

!_artifacts/**
!docker-entrypoint.sh

# The built-in updater has no business in an image, and deleting it after the COPY would not make the
# image any smaller: the layer that brought it in still carries it, so it is still downloaded. Kept
# out of the build context instead, where it can never land in a layer at all.
_artifacts/**/Sonarr.Update
_artifacts/**/Sonarr.Update/**
